        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been hired as a staff member in charge of this operation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the five days, please do not miss typing specific sentences and checking the surveillance cameras.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Notice of Employment】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration: 5 days</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Working hours: 0:00 AM to 6:00 AM</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duties: Typing specific sentences and monitoring rooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salary: Paid at the end of the workday</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※We are not responsible for any damage caused by this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Game Description】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monativity Surveillance” is a game in which you have to enter specific sentences and report anomalies that appear in the surveillance camera images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two main things to do in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type in the sentences displayed on the computer screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switching between multiple surveillance cameras and reporting any anomalies that appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The work hours will be from midnight to 6:00 a.m., and you will be required to do this for five days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(There is some slight horror in this game. If this is not your cup of tea, please beware)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Playing time】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About <strong>30 to 60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to collect all endings, it will take <strong>about 2  to 3 hour</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Operation Methods】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WS key, arrow keys (up/down): Move to surveillance camera and computer screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AD key, arrow keys (left/right): Switch camera images when viewing surveillance cameras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click: Reporting anomalies, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key: Show/hide the menu screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions are also provided in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Rules for Live Streaming and Distribution】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is welcome to play and stream the game (no permission is required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through distribution is also acceptable for both corporations and individuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video or streaming video, and a link to the Steam store page in the summary section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posting or live distribution of content that is offensive to public order and morals or that significantly damages the value of the game is prohibited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will not be held responsible for any damages incurred by the publisher or any third party as a result of posting or live distribution of videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The above terms and conditions are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been hired as a staff member in charge of this operation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the five days, please do not miss typing specific sentences and checking the surveillance cameras.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Notice of Employment】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration: 5 days</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Working hours: 0:00 AM to 6:00 AM</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duties: Typing specific sentences and monitoring rooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salary: Paid at the end of the workday</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※We are not responsible for any damage caused by this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Game Description】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monativity Surveillance” is a game in which you have to enter specific sentences and report anomalies that appear in the surveillance camera images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two main things to do in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type in the sentences displayed on the computer screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switching between multiple surveillance cameras and reporting any anomalies that appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The work hours will be from midnight to 6:00 a.m., and you will be required to do this for five days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(There is some slight horror in this game. If this is not your cup of tea, please beware)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Playing time】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About <strong>30 to 60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to collect all endings, it will take <strong>about 2  to 3 hour</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Operation Methods】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WS key, arrow keys (up/down): Move to surveillance camera and computer screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AD key, arrow keys (left/right): Switch camera images when viewing surveillance cameras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click: Reporting anomalies, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc key: Show/hide the menu screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation instructions are also provided in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Rules for Live Streaming and Distribution】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is welcome to play and stream the game (no permission is required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through distribution is also acceptable for both corporations and individuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video or streaming video, and a link to the Steam store page in the summary section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posting or live distribution of content that is offensive to public order and morals or that significantly damages the value of the game is prohibited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will not be held responsible for any damages incurred by the publisher or any third party as a result of posting or live distribution of videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The above terms and conditions are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul>",
